  "title": "亲近的人，也是独立的两个人",
  "transcript_quality": "source-unverified",
  "transcript_source_kind": "local-caption-copy",
  "units": [
    {
      "end_seconds": 2.56,
      "id": "cue-1",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 0.32,
      "text": "有一天我突然\n生出来这样一个感觉"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 3.84,
      "id": "cue-2",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "就是我看着我的娃"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 7.28,
      "id": "cue-3",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "然后我感觉到\n我对他很陌生"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 9.76,
      "id": "cue-4",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 8.08,
      "text": "我和他是没有关系的\n两个人"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 13.36,
      "id": "cue-5",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 11.12,
      "text": "就当然我跟我的娃\n是有关系的"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 15.92,
      "id": "cue-6",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 13.6,
      "text": "我看到他我想到他\n我就会笑对吧"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 18.08,
      "id": "cue-7",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 15.92,
      "text": "然后他的就是\n一举一动啊"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 19.76,
      "id": "cue-8",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 18.08,
      "text": "说的话呀我都能听懂啊"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 20.8,
      "id": "cue-9",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 19.76,
      "text": "或者说是感受到啊"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 23.76,
      "id": "cue-10",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 22.32,
      "text": "但是我和他本质上\n还是两个人"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 26.64,
      "id": "cue-11",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 24.96,
      "text": "这两个人和我\n和大街上的"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 28.88,
      "id": "cue-12",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 26.64,
      "text": "任何一个陌生人\n有什么区别吗"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 31.52,
      "id": "cue-13",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 29.92,
      "text": "其实本质上\n没有什么区别"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 34.56,
      "id": "cue-14",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 32.88,
      "text": "我就既然是两个人"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 35.44,
      "id": "cue-15",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 34.64,
      "text": "那我和他的"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 36.667,
      "id": "cue-16",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 35.467,
      "text": "和跟你的关系是一样的"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 40.187,
      "id": "cue-17",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 37.147,
      "text": "对就是就是\n哪怕是父子这种关系"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 41.627,
      "id": "cue-18",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 40.267,
      "text": "他是身上带了我的基因"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 44.427,
      "id": "cue-19",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 42.107,
      "text": "但是对就是两个体"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 45.947,
      "id": "cue-20",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 44.667,
      "text": "我我我不知道这种感觉"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 48.507,
      "id": "cue-21",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 46.027,
      "text": "当当时那种感觉\n是挺神奇的"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 50.507,
      "id": "cue-22",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 48.587,
      "text": "所以说\n我把它跟大家讲一下"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 53.067,
      "id": "cue-23",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 50.907,
      "text": "不知道大家能不能\n体会到那个感受"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 55.227,
      "id": "cue-24",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 53.067,
      "text": "就是你不能去\n从字面上意意思上"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 56.427,
      "id": "cue-25",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 55.227,
      "text": "去理解\n然后体会这个感受"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 58.027,
      "id": "cue-26",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 56.427,
      "text": "就是你看到你的娃"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 59.227,
      "id": "cue-27",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 58.027,
      "text": "或者说你看到你的父母"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 61.627,
      "id": "cue-28",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 59.947,
      "text": "你发现这是完全\n截然不同两个人"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 64.347,
      "id": "cue-29",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 61.627,
      "text": "其实没有一毛\n一点关系的那种感觉"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 65.627,
      "id": "cue-30",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 64.667,
      "text": "然后在这种关系之下"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 67.947,
      "id": "cue-31",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 65.627,
      "text": "然后你再去\n看跟他的缘分"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 71.067,
      "id": "cue-32",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 68.427,
      "text": "你就会有一种\n怎么说呢感恩之心吧"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 72.507,
      "id": "cue-33",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 71.147,
      "text": "或者说你跟任何一个人"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 74.027,
      "id": "cue-34",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 72.507,
      "text": "比如说\n你要追一个美女啊"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 76.027,
      "id": "cue-35",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 74.107,
      "text": "然后你会觉得"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 78.107,
      "id": "cue-36",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 76.187,
      "text": "就是我对你这么好\n然后你为什么对我不好"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 80.347,
      "id": "cue-37",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 78.427,
      "text": "啊为什么我们\n有可能最后"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 82.587,
      "id": "cue-38",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 80.587,
      "text": "没有没有没有\n就是没有没有在一起"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 83.867,
      "id": "cue-39",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 82.987,
      "text": "你会有一些"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 86.267,
      "id": "cue-40",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 84.667,
      "text": "别的就是不好的心"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 88.187,
      "id": "cue-41",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 86.747,
      "text": "但是如果你意识到了"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 90.667,
      "id": "cue-42",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 88.187,
      "text": "本身就是\n没有任何人欠你吧"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 92.267,
      "id": "cue-43",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 90.667,
      "text": "或者说你们的关系就是"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 93.707,
      "id": "cue-44",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 92.587,
      "text": "陌路就是尘缘"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 96.507,
      "id": "cue-45",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 94.267,
      "text": "然后你在这基础之上\n又有了一些"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 98.587,
      "id": "cue-46",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 96.667,
      "text": "就是呃缘分的话"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 100.027,
      "id": "cue-47",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 98.587,
      "text": "那那些缘分就是全部了"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 100.907,
      "id": "cue-48",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 100.187,
      "text": "大概是这种感觉吧"
    }
